  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistics concerning incoming delegation of journalists from Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eighteen journalists from C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, Ethiopia, Ghana, Kenya, Nigeria, Rwanda, South Africa, Tanzania and Uganda will visit the Netherlands, as the Dutch Association of Agricultural Journalism is organising an international conference from 10-15 July in Wageningen.The idea is that these journalists will learn what the innovative Dutch agriculture sector has to offer in different fields, to contribute to local development and create good Holland branding.</narrative>
  </description>
